<title>ESTONIA: MOST BANKING STOCKS END HIGHER ON SOLID TRADE.</title>
<headline>MOST BANKING STOCKS END HIGHER ON SOLID TRADE.</headline>
<text>
<p>* Total trade on the Estonian bourse was 54.3 million kroons of shares.</p>
<p>* Talse gained 1.61 percent to close on 237.03</p>
<p>* Hoiupank and Uhispank were the most active stocks to close higher</p>
<p>* Hansapank turns over 3.7 million kroons of shares to gain</p>
</text>
